        <mxCell id="note-responsibility" parent="standalone-boundary" style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=20;fillColor=#F2F8FC;strokeColor=#5A93B8;strokeWidth=1.5;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=14;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=13;fontColor=#264F69;" value="&lt;b&gt;Standalone owns host mechanics:&lt;/b&gt; trusted tenant/source binding; Alert revision, endpoint, and source-generation lifecycle; package-derived declarative JSON normalization; DI receipt + Notable outbox; openitsi.notables.v1 publication and independent correlation admission; selected NATS/RTS delivery; quota-bounded External Kafka workers; PostgreSQL durability, health, and evidence. POST /api/internal/notable-events remains the explicit direct-Core compatibility exception." vertex="1">
